@startuml
title UC-06 - Admin maintains catalogue
actor "Administrator" as A
participant "AdminRoutes" as R
participant "ResourceService" as S
participant "SQLiteUnitOfWork" as T
database "ResourceRepository" as Repo
A -> R : create/edit/disable(resource)
R -> S : change_resource(user, data)
S -> S : require ADMIN role
alt non-admin actor
  S --> A : forbidden; no changes
else authorized actor
  S -> S : check required fields, unique code
  alt duplicate code or invalid input
    S --> A : validation error
  else valid change
    S -> T : BEGIN IMMEDIATE
    S -> Repo : save resource change
    Repo --> S : saved
    S -> T : commit()
    S --> A : change confirmed
  end
end
note over A,S
  Disabling blocks NEW requests.
  It does not silently cancel existing confirmed bookings.
end note
@enduml